      "message": "Do we have a standard on how we want to do this piece? The migrate phase can either be done *in* the API as calls are made, done via a migration script like keystone-manage db_migrate \u003cmigration\u003e, or both. \n\nAre we going to provide guidance on this or is it going to be treated on a case-by-case basis?",
